\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\tab If you have Gaia don't worry about the sealevel. It's automatically the sealevel that's setup in Gaia +3. You have to spawn runtime objects in Gaia for this to work though. Otherwise set the sealevel to the height of your water surface.\par
\par
