step5. Add Buildings if you do not want to use the Default Cube buildings. Proceed to step5a if you'd like your own buildings.\par
\tab new! now you can place the buildings directly into the arrays and they will be setup automatically unless they are modular. Proceed to step 5a if your building is modular.\par
