\tab step5c Add your building model to the empty gameobject.\par
\tab step5dprefab the empty gameobject and name it. Also add a BuildingType Component to it.\par
\tab step5e Open the prefab.\par
\tab step5f Adjust the X and Z values of size on the BuildingType Component. Use the blue gizmo as a guide. Set the Y value to to something that encapsulates the building on the y axis.\tab\par
